## The Modern Media Buying Truth: Creative is Your New Targeting

With Meta Advantage+ and TikTok Smart Performance Campaigns automating audience targeting, performance marketers no longer compete on bid hacks or lookalike percentages. **The ad creative itself is the primary targeting lever.**

The algorithm segments buyers based on who watches your specific video hooks. If your creative portfolio is limited to 1 or 2 videos, your campaigns quickly plateau into high customer acquisition costs.

---

## The 3x2x2 Creative Matrix Breakdown

Rather than filming 12 completely unrelated concepts, high-growth DTC brands build a structured permutation matrix:

- **3 Distinct Hooks (H1, H2, H3)**:
  - H1: Visual Pain Point Demo
  - H2: Shocking Question / Myth Buster
  - H3: Direct Customer Testimonial
- **2 Core Body Angles (B1, B2)**:
  - B1: Product Features & Ergonomic Design
  - B2: Lifestyle Integration & Ease of Use
- **2 Closing Offers (C1, C2)**:
  - C1: "Get 20% Off Today with Free Shipping"
  - C2: "30-Day Money-Back Guarantee, Zero Risk"

By combining these segments: `3 Hooks × 2 Bodies × 2 CTAs = 12 Unique Video Variations`!

---

## 24-Hour Killing and Scaling Rules

| Metric | Target Threshold | Action Plan |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **3s Hook Rate** | > 35% | Hook successful. Retain and iterate on body variations. |
| **3s Hook Rate** | < 20% | Hook failed. Turn off ad set within 24 hours. |
| **Completion Rate** | > 15% | High engagement. Excellent candidate for budget scaling. |
| **Outbound CTR** | > 2.5% | Compelling offer. Move to core scaling campaign. |
| **Add-to-Cart Rate** | > 4% | Winning creative. Allocate 70% of scaling budget. |
